    "Every pair used identical manifests, features and probes with only FERROUI_XAML_BACKEND changed.",
    "Application sizes include native imports, runtime and code signatures.",
    "The measured source already contains ConstructionResults, standalone selector bytecode and the captured equality operand. A later accessor type witness for an out-of-corpus generic equality conversion was verified separately after the snapshot.",
    "The selector_corpus section compares generated sources before and after standalone selectors; counts are compiler output, not linked data. The after output covers all 13 original visitor shapes. Full-app measurements use only the frozen source.",
    "Source-freezing redirects rustc source entry paths for the five listed compiler/runtime crates to the copies corresponding to the saved patch. Native and bytecode were both rebuilt in the isolated target.",
    "Named link-map resource counts are a lower bound; optimized constants may lose their original symbol names.",
    "Exact program-pattern checks count distinct logical payloads of at least 32 bytes. Inlining, sharing and overlapping substrings prevent interpreting the sum of matched lengths as allocated bytes."
